OL,3,GNEWSAHow will the heatwaves affect
OL,4,Anature in the West?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis year has seen a summer of
OL,7,Frecord-breaking temperatures and
OL,8,Fprolonged dry weather across the West.
OL,9,FBut as meteorological summer comes to
OL,10,Fan end this month, what will the
OL,11,Flong-term impacts of the relentless
OL,12,Fheat be?
OL,14,FFive heatwaves, with temperatures
OL,15,Freaching up to 36.7C at one point, have
OL,16,Ftaken a toll on daily life, disrupting
OL,17,Ftravel, forcing schools to close and
OL,18,Fcausing wildfires.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
