OL,3,GNEWSAHow will the heatwaves affect
OL,4,Anature in the West?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough temperatures have started to
OL,7,Fdrop, experts say the earth beneath our
OL,8,Ffeet and our wildlife has suffered
OL,9,Flasting harm.
OL,11,FHeightened temperatures across the
OL,12,Fsummer months have hit nature hard
OL,13,Faccording to Stuart McCarthy-Thompson,
OL,14,Fwho works at the Avon Wildlife Trust.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
